OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum's new art pays 'homage' to
OL,4,AFrench founder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA County Durham museum is paying
OL,7,F"homage" to its French founder's routes
OL,8,Fby bringing in works she would have
OL,9,Fapproved of for its newest exhibition.
OL,11,FThe Bowes Museum in Barnard Castle has
OL,12,Flinked up with a museum in Le Havre for
OL,13,FImpressions of Light, featuring a
OL,14,Fnumber of impressionist paintings never
OL,15,Fbefore been seen in the UK.
OL,17,FThe display also highlights the links
OL,18,Fbetween the museum's founders, John
OL,19,FBowes and his Parisian wife Josephine,
OL,20,Fand the French art world.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
