OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum's new art pays 'homage' to
OL,4,AFrench founder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe museum said the exhibition, which
OL,7,Fwill run until 14 March, involved a
OL,8,Fdetailed planning operation to secure
OL,9,Fall necessary permissions and
OL,10,Flogistical arrangements, with
OL,11,Fspecialist art couriers transporting
OL,12,Fthe works.
